{"reviewId": "426066534_8bdNlMX8u", "review": {"abstract": "欧债问题从本质上讲是一个财政问题，在有效的财政改革政策出台前，欧债问题将继续深化。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "欧元区理论上是最贴近世界大一统的模型，但是现在一缺少军事力量，二没有出现一位个人魅力超群的领导人统一思想。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "3505-3546", "createTime": 1786242221, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_8bdNlMX8u", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 52240177, "name": "E", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epBcZXOQk6uyuicxdLCQU9micJoK71tJvyq0ayJOJIpHXWic0ESkfjzK8eGQnU5nxvVdaP0Rd02kia0gcxhIZrVugete6ib8bWmUnQoE6zRD77iahMg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "恰恰相反，欧元区只是形式上的统一，货币政策统一管理，但是财政政策却可以自